# E-commerce Customer Shopping Analysis

## Project Overview
This project focuses on analysing e-commerce customer shopping data using Python to identify purchasing patterns, sales trends and customer behaviour.

## Objectives
- Analyse customer purchasing behaviour.
- Identify popular product categories.
- Understand sales and revenue patterns.
- Examine customer demographics.
- Visualize insights using charts.

## Tools and Technologies
- Python
- Pandas
- NumPy
- Matplotlib
- Seaborn
- VS Code

## Project Workflow
1. Dataset import
2. Data cleaning and preprocessing
3. Exploratory Data Analysis (EDA)
4. Data visualization
5. Analysis and insights

## Project Structure
- dataset/: Original and cleaned datasets
- visualizations/: Generated charts
- ecommerce_analysis.py: Python analysis code

